"# Docker Ignore File - Project 1\n# This file specifies files and directories to exclude from the Docker build context.\n\n# Node Modules (typically managed with npm or yarn)\nnode_modules/\n*.log\n\n# Build Artifacts\nbild/ \n*.out \n\n# Local OS Specific Files\n.DS_Store\nThumbs.db\n\n# Editor Temp Files\ndir/tmp/\n\n# IDE Specific Files (e.g., VS Code settings)\n.vscode/\n".idea/\n\n# Other Sensitive or Unnecessary Files\nsecrets.txt\nhooks/\nscripts/\n"